%% 最小 Goal-driven Loop 基础设施：组件与一次状态推进
%% Runtime 中没有自动循环；是否发起下一次 transition 由调用方决定。
flowchart TD
    subgraph caller["调用方（负责编排）"]
        Goal["Goal"]
        Input["RunInput"]
        Current["当前 RunState"]
        Next["下一 RunState"]
        Handle["处理结果并结束本次调用"]
    end

    subgraph runtime["@kai/runtime"]
        Create["createRun"]
        Transition["transition（纯函数）"]
        Store[("RunStore")]
    end

    Goal -->|创建| Create
    Create -->|created RunState| Current
    Current -->|可选 save| Store
    Store -->|按 runId 加载| Current
    Current -->|currentState| Transition
    Input -->|input| Transition
    Transition -->|ok: true，nextState| Next
    Transition -->|ok: false，原状态和错误| Handle
    Next -->|save| Store
    Next --> Handle

    classDef callerStyle fill:#eef4ff,stroke:#4f7cac,color:#1d3557
    class Goal,Input,Current,Next,Handle callerStyle
    classDef runtimeStyle fill:#f4f7f4,stroke:#5b8062,color:#24442b
    class Create,Transition,Store runtimeStyle
